       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ROBOTIC-TYPO.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ROBOTIC-TYPO-PROOFS.
           05  WS-STROKE-CONSERVE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LOCOMOTION-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PHOSPHOR-DECAY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TYPO-LATENCY-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TYPO-SEAL-OK             PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-TYPO-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PTY-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PTY-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-STROKE-AND-LOCO.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DECAY-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PTY-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-STROKE-AND-LOCO.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STROKE-CONSERVE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LOCOMOTION-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DECAY-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PHOSPHOR-DECAY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TYPO-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PTY-PROOFS.
           IF WS-STROKE-CONSERVE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LOCOMOTION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PHOSPHOR-DECAY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TYPO-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TYPO-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PTY-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PTY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PTY-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PTY-CODE.
